# {{ project_name }}

{{ description }}

A Python 3.14.7 command-line project using **uv**, **Cyclopts**, **Rich**, **ruamel.yaml**, **Ruff**, and **pytest**.

## Start

```sh
uv sync --group dev
uv run {{ cli_command }} --help
uv run {{ cli_command }} hello --name developer
uv run {{ cli_command }} show-config --path config.example.yml
```

Commit the generated `uv.lock` for repeatable dependency resolution and CI runs.

## Develop

```sh
uv run pytest -q
uv run ruff check .
uv run ruff format --check .
uv build
```

`src/{{ package_name }}/cli.py` is the command interface. Put logic in separate modules and test those first.
See `AGENTS.md` for TDD and environment isolation conventions.

## Automation

`.github/workflows/ci.yml` delegates PR validation and distribution-building to
[RuchirChawdhry/ci-workflows](https://github.com/RuchirChawdhry/ci-workflows).
It runs for pull requests, not pushes or schedules. No PyPI publishing is enabled.

## Updating from the Copier template

The `.copier-answers.yml` tracks the source template and your answers:

```sh
uvx copier update
```
